Using the Marin InstructionDataset and SFT scripts I launched a training run to fine-tune on these 10M tokens and the results were promising so far!  I still need to share this publicly so this link might be useless for now but I will include it: https://wandb.ai/michael-nlp/marin/runs/qwen3-0.6b-rephraser-sft-875a72

I trained on a tpu v5-p8 node and used the same 20 docs I discussed previously in the spec adherence section with 5 specs from control bench run on GPT-OSS-120B as a validation set.  The 5 specs were: "basic", "nemotron", "article_extractor", "detailed01", "hand_optimized".  I may need to reflect later if this means I need to make entirely different specs/docs for a test set later for validity, but wanted to get some signal right now:

